# SoMe App — source of truth

Wire-like chat + community-scoped profiles. Not Pintap. Not a payments or dating marketplace.

Read when the task needs it: spec v0.33, meeting transcript, mockup `SoMe App 260922`, `docs/User-Stories-and-Requirements.tex`.

## Invariants (never violate)

- Scope every member/chat/search/schema query by **current `community_id`**.
- Group ≠ community. Group = chat room inside one community.
- Profile fields are **defs + values**, not hardcoded columns.
- Verified image = in-app camera + date. Do not claim it cannot be faked.
- Private notes/ratings: author-only in UI **and** API.
- V1 group create = community/group admin only.

## Stop — do not implement

**Later:** payments, Swish, reputation, profile score, push, video/audio, co-admins, Google login, cross-community search.

**TBD — ask:** 2 vs 3 bottom tabs; path vs subdomain; account scope; ads-as-posts vs A6–D3; first-community field list; user levels 1–3.

If sources conflict, name the conflict. Do not pick a winner.
